      <h1>WE ARE NOT ARTISTS. WE ARE THE VERY GROUND FROM WHICH ART RISES.</h1>
      <p>Botaki Ba Afrika is a collective, not a gallery. Every piece we make belongs to the group before it belongs to any one artist.</p>
