        <div class="eyebrow">Our story</div>
        <h2 class="heading" style="font-size:24px;">Art Is a System. We Are Its Stewards.</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--white);">Botaki Ba Afrika is a multidisciplinary creative organisation rooted in the
            belief that art is both a practice and a system. One that requires care,
            structure and intentional stewardship to remain sustainable. Founded
            within community-based and artist-led contexts. Botaki Ba Afrika operates
            at the intersection of music, literature, visual art, research and public
            engagement, centring African ways of knowing, making and relating.</p>
        <p style="color: var(--white)">At its core Botaki Ba Afrika exists to support creatives not only to produce work,
            but to sustain their practice over time. This means working across the full
            creative lifecycle from ideation, research, documentation and archiving.
            Our work recognises that artistic labour is often fragmented particularly
            within the South African context that hold creative work with dignity.</p>
      </div>

